      "text": "WHY DETERMINISTIC VERIFICATION MATTERS\nChecking app state \u2014 not screenshots, not an LLM judge \u2014\nmeans the grader is exact and reproducible. That is what\nmakes it a verifiable reward function, not a vibe check.",
