      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE QUESTIONS THIS INVITES \u2014 have answers ready\n  \u00b7 How do you patch a CVE with no registry?\n  \u00b7 How does telemetry get OUT of the gap?\n  \u00b7 How do you reproduce a run six months later? (pin everything, including the base image digest)",
      "originalText": "THE QUESTIONS THIS INVITES \u2014 have answers ready\n  \u00b7 How do you patch a CVE with no registry?\n  \u00b7 How does telemetry get OUT of the gap?\n  \u00b7 How do you reproduce a run six months later? (pin everything, including the base image digest)",
